{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "triton-vision-learning",
  "title": "Triton - Vision Inference",
  "description": "Prometheus monitoring for triton-deployment.yaml and perf-analyzer.yaml. Server averages are not client latency percentiles.",
  "tags": ["triton", "inference", "resnet50"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {"from": "now-30m", "to": "now"},
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "NVIDIA Triton metrics reference",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://docs.nvidia.com/deeplearning/triton-inference-server/user-guide/docs/user_guide/metrics.html",
      "targetBlank": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "job",
        "label": "Triton scrape job",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource"},
        "query": "label_values(nv_inference_request_success, job)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "instance",
        "label": "Server instance",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource"},
        "query": "label_values(nv_inference_request_success{job=~\"$job\"}, instance)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "model",
        "label": "Model",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource"},
        "query": "label_values(nv_inference_request_success{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\"}, model)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Setup and interpretation",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 7},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Before using this dashboard\nImport this JSON in Grafana and select your Prometheus datasource. Prometheus must already scrape **each Triton pod's port 8002 at `/metrics`**. The Deployment exposes that port, but its Service alone does not configure scraping. No Prometheus installation or cluster changes are included here.\n\nFor an approved plain-Prometheus setup, a single-replica learning target can use:\n```yaml\nscrape_configs:\n  - job_name: triton-server\n    scrape_interval: 15s\n    static_configs:\n      - targets: ['triton-server.default.svc.cluster.local:8002']\n```\nReplace `default` with the Deployment's namespace. For Prometheus Operator, have the monitoring owner configure a ServiceMonitor selecting this Service (it currently has no metadata labels), port name `metrics`, path `/metrics`. Prefer pod discovery for multiple replicas; do not add a duplicate scrape.\n\nSelect the Triton job, instance and model (normally `resnet50`). **Scrape up is not model readiness.** No data can mean scraping/model loading is missing; it is not zero activity. Latency panels show **server-side means**, not p95/p99 or HTTP round-trip latency. Compare with Perf Analyzer's client results. GPU panels are optional, per device, not per model; MIG/Volcano support and accounting must be verified before treating them as your allocated share. Rate windows can smooth the analyzer's short concurrency steps."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Metrics scrape up (not model readiness)",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 7, "w": 8, "h": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"min": 0, "max": 1}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "up{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Successful requests / second",
      "gridPos": {"x": 8, "y": 7, "w": 8, "h": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (model, version) (rate(nv_inference_request_success{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\",model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{model}} v{{version}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Failed requests / second",
      "gridPos": {"x": 16, "y": 7, "w": 8, "h": 6},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "reqps", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (model, version, reason) (rate(nv_inference_request_failure{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\",model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval]))", "legendFormat": "{{model}} v{{version}} {{reason}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mean server request latency",
      "description": "Rate of cumulative request duration divided by successful request rate, converted from microseconds to milliseconds. Idle series omitted; not a percentile or client round-trip latency.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 13, "w": 8, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "ms", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "(sum by (model, version) (rate(nv_inference_request_duration_us{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\",model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval])) / (sum by (model, version) (rate(nv_inference_request_success{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\",model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval])) > 0)) / 1000", "legendFormat": "{{model}} v{{version}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Mean server queue time",
      "description": "Includes time waiting for dynamic batching. Idle series omitted. The model's configured 5000 microsecond batch delay is not an overall queue-latency ceiling under load.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 8, "y": 13, "w": 8, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "ms", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "(sum by (model, version) (rate(nv_inference_queue_duration_us{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\",model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval])) / (sum by (model, version) (rate(nv_inference_request_success{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\",model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval])) > 0)) / 1000", "legendFormat": "{{model}} v{{version}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Average executed batch size",
      "description": "Inference count / execution count, excluding cached requests. Perf Analyzer uses client batch 1, but Triton's dynamic batcher may combine requests. Idle series omitted.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 16, "y": 13, "w": 8, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "short", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (model, version) (rate(nv_inference_count{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\",model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval])) / (sum by (model, version) (rate(nv_inference_exec_count{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\",model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval])) > 0)", "legendFormat": "{{model}} v{{version}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GPU utilization (optional, device scope)",
      "description": "Triton GPU metrics may be absent or not represent the isolated share on MIG/Volcano. Do not interpret missing data as idle GPU.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 20, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "max": 1}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "nv_gpu_utilization{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{gpu_uuid}}"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "GPU memory used / total (optional, device scope)",
      "description": "Device-level telemetry, not the configured Volcano memory limit or model-only memory usage.",
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 20, "w": 12, "h": 7},
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "$datasource"},
      "fieldConfig": {"defaults": {"unit": "bytes", "min": 0}, "overrides": []},
      "targets": [
        {"refId": "A", "expr": "nv_gpu_memory_used_bytes{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{gpu_uuid}} used"},
        {"refId": "B", "expr": "nv_gpu_memory_total_bytes{job=~\"$job\",instance=~\"$instance\"}", "legendFormat": "{{instance}} {{gpu_uuid}} total"}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
